{
  "abstract": "{\"business_domain\":[\"巨量营销-人群定向、DMP 与 RTA\"],\"business_line\":[\"巨量营销\"],\"capability_summary\":\"通过【数据源文件上传】接口得到file_path文件路径后，调用此接口将数据源文件创建成一个数据源，创建成功后会返回一个数据源id。数据源创建完成后，系统会进行解析生成人群包，人群包的生成进度可通过【数据源详细信息】查询。\",\"id\":\"dmp.data_source.create\",\"interface_path\":\"/open_api/2/dmp/data_source/create/\",\"method\":\"POST\",\"related_docs\":[{\"id\":\"dmp.data_source_file_upload\",\"path\":\"https://ad.oceanengine.com/openapi/doc/index.html?id=1696710568556544\",\"reason\":\"需要先通过此接口得到file_path文件路径，才能创建数据源\",\"relation\":\"前置接口\",\"title\":\"数据源文件上传\"},{\"id\":\"dmp.data_source_info\",\"path\":\"https://ad.oceanengine.com/openapi/doc/index.html?id=1696710570207247\",\"reason\":\"可通过此接口查询人群包的生成进度\",\"relation\":\"配合接口\",\"title\":\"数据源详细信息\"}],\"title\":\"数据源创建\"}",
  "content": "<div class=\"qz-editor-engine am-engine\" data-element=\"root\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-pk17hAa4\">通过<a href=\"https://ad.oceanengine.com/openapi/doc/index.html?id=1696710568556544\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"_blank\">【数据源文件上传】</a>接口得到file_path文件路径后，调用当前接口将数据源文件创建成一个数据源，创建成功后会返回一个数据源id，作为数据源的唯一标识。</p><blockquote data-id=\"b603af74-MbUPoqh2\" style=\"margin-top: 5px; margin-bottom: 5px; padding-left: 1em; margin-left: 0px; border-left: 3px solid rgb(238, 238, 238); opacity: 0.6;\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-mvMALxEZ\">数据源创建完成后，系统会进行一个数据源解析的过程，将数据源解析成对应的人群包，这个过程大概持续20-60分钟；（同时使用该功能的用户数量多时可能造成解析时间较长，超出60分钟，具体时长将由具体任务量决定，请耐心等待）。 人群包的生成进度可通过<a href=\"https://ad.oceanengine.com/openapi/doc/index.html?id=1696710570207247\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"_blank\">【数据源详细信息】</a>查询。</p></blockquote><div data-type=\"qzcard\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22borderColor%22%3A%22%23fed4a4%22%2C%22backgroundColor%22%3A%22%23fff5eb%22%2C%22text%22%3A%22%3Cul%20data-id%3D%5C%22u738a58b-KLrjKV7D%5C%22%3E%3Cli%20data-id%3D%5C%22ld70c578-WJ2lh1Qw%5C%22%3E%E7%9B%AE%E5%89%8D%E6%AF%8F%E4%B8%AA%E5%B9%BF%E5%91%8A%E4%B8%BB%E8%B4%A6%E5%8F%B7%E4%B8%80%E5%A4%A9%E5%8F%AA%E8%83%BD%E5%88%9B%E5%BB%BA100%E6%AC%A1%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%E6%BA%90%EF%BC%8C%E8%B6%85%E5%87%BA%E6%8A%A5%E9%94%99%EF%BC%81%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%20data-id%3D%5C%22ld70c578-4ekM8xWo%5C%22%3E%E4%B8%80%E6%AC%A1%E4%B8%8A%E4%BC%A0%E7%9A%84file_paths%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6%E8%B7%AF%E5%BE%84%E9%99%90%E5%88%B6%E4%B8%AA%E6%95%B0%E4%B8%BA1000%EF%BC%8C%E8%B6%85%E5%87%BA%E6%8A%A5%E9%94%99%EF%BC%81%3C%2Fli%3E%3C%2Ful%3E%22%2C%22id%22%3A%229cj4f%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22block%22%2C%22html%22%3A%22%3Cul%20data-id%3D%5C%22u738a58b-KLrjKV7D%5C%22%3E%3Cli%20data-id%3D%5C%22ld70c578-WJ2lh1Qw%5C%22%3E%E7%9B%AE%E5%89%8D%E6%AF%8F%E4%B8%AA%E5%B9%BF%E5%91%8A%E4%B8%BB%E8%B4%A6%E5%8F%B7