/path></svg></div><div class=\"QZCard-editor-container\"><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-KLrjKV7D\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-WJ2lh1Qw\">目前每个客户账号一天只能创建100次数据源，超出报错！</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-4ekM8xWo\">一次上传的file_paths文件路径限制个数为1000，超出报错！</li></ul></div></div></div>\n<div class=\"qz-api-metadata\" data-type=\"apimetadata\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22interfaceId%22%3A%201772464816391175%2C%20%22docLibId%22%3A%201743864733602830%7D\">\n \n</div>\n<h3 data-id=\"h6f20189-OQPv8eEX\" id=\"h6f20189-OQPv8eEX\">请求地址</h3><p data-id=\"p838747a-RjAcrikO\"><a href=\"https://ad.oceanengine.com/open_api/2/dmp/data_source/create/\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color: #333333;\">https://ad.oceanengine.com/open_api/2/dmp/data_source/create/</span></a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/tools/visual_debug.html?docId=1696710569089024\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">可视化调试</a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1773083358100557\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">SDK下载</a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1847394521222599\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">MCP调用</a></p><h3 data-id=\"h6f20189-APKIo1Sp\" id=\"h6f20189-APKIo1Sp\">请求方法</h3><p data-id=\"p838747a-uVjetuTP\">POST</p><h3 data-id=\"h6f20189-rdsUZC8e\" id=\"h6f20189-rdsUZC8e\">请求Header</h3><div class=\"table-container qz-card-type-block\"><table class=\"data-table data-table-row-header\" data-custom=\"false\" data-id=\"t3945309-BEn6DjQa\" data-transient-attributes