ttributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-g7Fh1vWb\">数据格式, 枚举值:<code style=\"font-family: monospace; font-size: inherit; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06); padding: 0px 2px; border-radius: 6px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">\"0\"</code>：ProtocolBuffer</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-CPWssZ4x\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td data-id=\"tff4a61f-RHF303MB\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-0cPQYLxE\">file_storage_type <span class=\"qz-tag-view qz-tag-type-must\" data-type=\"tag\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22tagType%22%3A%22must%22%2C%22tagValue%22%3A%22%E5%BF%85%E5%A1%AB%22%2C%22isCustom%22%3Afalse%2C%22id%22%3A%22P2CzG%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22inline%22%7D\" style=\"color:#338aff;background:#ebf3ff;\">必填</span></p></td><td data-id=\"tff4a61f-o8hWlDd5\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-DBkwxPtP\">string</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"td0a4e23-Swfyxdde\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-gEpl2BjT\">数据存储类型, 枚举值:<code style=\"font-family: monospace; font-size: inherit; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06); padding: 0px 2px; border-radius: 6px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">\"0\"</code>：API</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-iXrAV4xo\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td data-id=\"tff4a61f-WVizkjPM\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-gdI5VEsi\">file_paths <span class=\"qz-tag-view qz-tag-type-must\" data-type=\"tag\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22tagType%22%3A%22must%22%2C%22tagValue%22%3A%22%E5%BF%85%E5%A1%AB%22%2C%22isCustom%22%3Afalse%2C%22id%22%3A%22greQP%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22inline%22%7D\" style=\"color:#338aff;background:#ebf3ff;\">必填</span></p></td><td data-id=\"tff4a61f-2Gsh0aFY\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-EcJNS89j\">string[]</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"td0a4e23-PBrDSiAa\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-LAHeRJ6T\">通过<a href=\"https://ad.oceanengine.com/openapi/doc/index.html?id=1696710568556544\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"_blank\">【数据源文件上传】</a>接口得到的文件路径，<span style=\"color: #f00606;\">注意：</span>一次上传最多1000个</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-92lnH9uf\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td class=\"table-last-column\" data-id=\"t498e912-NBD0adUG\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-kuRzA3At\">data_source_type</p></td><td class=\"table-last-column\" data-id=\"t498e912-FYY6kJel\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-VbkU5l4M\">string</p></td><td class=\"table-last-column table-last-row\" colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"tb871063-JDSnAMG9\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-bFwdXTy2\">投放数据源类型，枚举值如下: <code style=\"font-family: monospace; font-size: inherit; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06); padding: 0px 2px; border-radius: 6px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\"><span style=\"color: #245bdb;\">\"UID\"</span></code>， <code style=\"font-family: monospace; font-size: inherit; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06); padding: 0px 2px; border-radius: 6px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\"><span style=\"color: #245bdb;\">\"DID\"</span></code></p><p data-id=\"p838747a-1Rz1LK1O\">选择\"UID\"时，会根据上传的标识去关联<span style=\"color: #8f959e;\">设备上登录的全部用户数据，数据相对量多而广泛；</span></p><p data-id=\"p838747a-BGm33G6C\">选择\"DID\"时，会根据上传的标识仅仅圈选出设备号相同的设备，数据相对量少而精确；</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-owjRppJW\">数据源类型为手机号_SHA256 ，仅支持 \"UID\" 模式；</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-pBbDHQjZ\">系统默认选择 UID 模式，请根据自身需要选择对应的模式；</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div><h3 data-id=\"h6f20189-Qx1yChR1\" id=\"h6f20189-Qx1yChR1\">请求示例</h3><div class=\"qz-codeblock_view qz-mulit-codeblock qz-card-type-block\" data-type=\"multicodeblock\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22langs%22%3A%5B%7B%22language%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22text%22%3A%22def%20create_dmp_data_source()%3A%20import%20requests%20open_api_url_prefix%20%3D%20%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fad.oceanengine.com%2Fopen_api%2F%5C%22%5Cnuri%20%3D%20%5C%222%2Fdmp%2Fdata_source%2Fcreate%2F%5C%22%5Cnurl%20%3D%20open_api_url_prefix%20%2B%20uri%20params%20%3D%20%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22advertiser_id%5C%22%3A%20xxx%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22data_source_name%5C%22%3A%20%5C%22%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%E6%BA%901%5C%22%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22description%5C%22%3A%20%5C%22%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%E6%BA%90%E6%8F%8F%E8%BF%B0%5C%22%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22data_format%5C%22%3A%200%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22file_storage_type%5C%22%3A%200%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22file_paths%5C%22%3A%20%5B%5C%22e20d7ff950c6c1c59510b8f5471f9c97%5C%22%5D%5Cn%7D%5Cnheaders%20%3D%20%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22Access-Token%5C%22%3A%20%5C%22xxx%5C%22%5Cn%7D%5Cnrsp%20%3D%20requests.post(url%2C%20json%20%3D%20params%2C%20headers%20%3D%20headers)%20rsp_data%20%3D%20rsp.json()%20return%20rsp_data%5Cn%22%7D%2C%7B%22language%22%3A%22java%22%2C%22text%22%3A%22public%20static%20JSONObject%20createDmpDataSource()%20%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20String%20access_token%20%3D%20%5C%22xxx%5C%22%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20final%20Long%20advertiser_id%20%3D%200L%3B%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20%2F%2F%20%E8%AF%B7%E6%B1%82%E5%9C%B0%E5%9D%80%5Cn%20%20%20%20String%20open_api_url_prefix%20%3D%20%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fad.oceanengine.com%2Fopen_api%2F2%2F%5C%22%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20String%20uri%20%3D%20%5C%22dmp%2Fdata_source%2Fcreate%2F%5C%22%3B%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20%2F%2F%20%E8%AF%B7%E6%B1%82%E5%8F%82%E6%95%B0%5Cn%20%20%20%20Map%20data%20%3D%20new%20HashMap()%20%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20put(%5C%22advertiser_id%5C%22%2C%20advertiser_id)%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20put(%5C%22data_source_name%5C%22%2C%20%5C%22%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%E6%BA%901%5C%22)%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20put(%5C%22description%5C%22%2C%20%5C%22%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%E6%BA%90%E6%8F%8F%E8%BF%B0%5C%22)%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20put(%5C%22data_format%5C%22%2C%200)%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20put(%5C%22file_storage_type%5C%22%2C%200)%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20put(%5C%22file_paths%5C%22%2C%20new%20String%5B%5D%7B%5C%22e20d7ff950c6c1c59510b8f5471f9c97%5C%22%7D)%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%7D%5Cn%20%20%20%20%7D%3B%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20%2F%2F%20%E6%9E%84%E9%80%A0%E8%AF%B7%E6%B1%82%5Cn%20%20%20%20HttpPost%20httpEntity%20%3D%20new%20HttpPost(open_api_url_prefix%20%2B%20uri)%3B%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20httpEntity.setHeader(%5C%22Access-Token%5C%22%2C%20access_token)%3B%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20CloseableHttpResponse%20response%20%3D%20null%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20CloseableHttpClient%20